The function is already minimal, so I only added a branch-prediction hint on the cold invalid-path test, letting the compiler lay out the common valid-field case as the fall-through path.

```cpp
FIT_UINT8 Field::GetNum(void) const
{
    if (__builtin_expect((profile == NULL) || (profileIndex >= profile->numFields), 0))
        return FIT_FIELD_NUM_INVALID;
    return profile->fields[profileIndex].num;
}
```